flowchart TB
  subgraph P[生产收口域]
    P0[StateStore 证明 production implement 身份] --> P1[生产 DAG 读取 PR 头与 main]
    P1 --> P2{main 已包含?}
    P2 -- 否 --> P3[merge 并做定点验证]
    P2 -- 是 --> P4[冻结生产 SHA]
    P3 --> P4
    P4 --> P5[同头 review APPROVED]
    P5 --> P6[同头 CI OK]
    P6 --> P7[approve gate 绑定 needs-review 回执]
  end

  subgraph H[房外 QA 控制域]
    H0[StateStore 证明 production QA 身份] --> H00[快照并清理递归 slots 2 和 3]
    H00 --> H1[Lead 授权安全 fixture]
    H1 --> H2[隔离 clone 安装并构建依赖]
    P7 --> H2
    H2 --> H3[显式占两个空槽]
    H3 --> H4[记录生产基线后启动受测房]
    H5[核验九步原始证据] --> H55[生产前后不变与 worktree 全量扫描]
    H55 --> H6[先快照再 owner teardown]
    H6 --> H7[房外签发 QA verdict]
  end

  subgraph I[房内受测域 只写 QA sandbox]
    I1[真实 Claude 设计评审] --> I2[Implement attempt 1]
    I2 --> I3[QA stub 注入 FAIL]
    I3 --> I4[统一恢复口]
    I4 --> I5[新 execution 与 dispatch ledger]
    I5 --> I6[QA stub 放行 fixture run]
  end

  H4 --> I1
  I6 --> H5

  X1[禁止生产 issue FLY-2922] -. fail closed .-> H4
  X2[禁止房内触达生产 PR] -. fail closed .-> I2
  X3[身份不匹配只走 no-code 出口] -. fail closed .-> P0
